SUMMARY:'Quin Chat: Survival Mode & What It's Costing You
LOCATION:Scottie's
DESCRIPTION:Category: ‘Quin Chat\nPrice: Free / Included\nStatus: You are
  on Waitlist\nEvent URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808\n\
 n7:00PM Reception\, 7:30PM Discussion\nIn a world that celebrates constant
  achievement\, many founders and executives spend more time in survival mo
 de than they realize. The cost can show up in their clarity\, decision-mak
 ing\, relationships\, health\, and ultimately\, how they lead.\n\nJoin int
 ernationally recognized keynote speaker\, leadership advisor\, and bestsel
 ling author Unni Turrettini for an illuminating evening exploring what hap
 pens when pressure becomes your default state\, why even highly successful
  people can get stuck there\, and how your internal state affects the way 
 you think\, work\, and make decisions.\n\nDrawing from her research and gl
 obal career spanning law\, finance\, and leadership development\, Unni wil
 l share practical insights into recognizing your own survival mode pattern
 s and shifting into a state where you can think more clearly\, make better
  decisions\, and perform under pressure without it taking such a personal 
 toll.\n\nFollowing the discussion\, members are invited to participate in 
 an interactive Q&A and book signing of Unni’s newest release\, Soulware
 : A High Achiever’s Guide to Divine Connection in the Age of AI.\n\nThis
  event is complimentary and reserved for members only. Complimentary lite 
 bites and refreshments will be served\, and copies of Soulware will be ava
 ilable for purchase. We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at leas
 t 24 hours prior to the start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/198808
CATEGORIES:‘Quin Chat
END:VEVENT
